From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 11:00:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] gridcraft: rustfmt the files the patch queue touches (mechanical formatting, regenerate on every sync)

`rustfmt --edition 2024` over every .rs file touched by patches 0001-0110, so `cargo fmt --all --check` is clean in CI
lint. No behaviour change. Always the last patch of the queue: scripts/sync-upstream.sh never rebases it, it
regenerates it (`--fmt`, or implied when the queue has this patch).
---
